# Ignore local Terraform cache directories recursively
**/.terraform/

# Ignore provider lock files recursively
**/.terraform.lock.hcl

# Ignore all state files and backups recursively
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*

# Ignore auto-generated crash logs recursively
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log

# Ignore local environment variable files (secrets) recursively
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfvars.json

# Ignore local override files recursively
**/*.tf_override
**/*.tf_override.json
**/override.tf
**/override.tf.json